#. ~ Description of "deltoid ballistic plates"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of NIJ Level III ballistic plates with a concave profile, made of UHMW"
" polyethylene.  \"STRIKE FACE\" is printed on its outer surface.  These "
"plates are designed to be worn in the shoulder pockets of suitable plate "
"carriers or combat shirts, and can resist several high-energy rifle rounds "
"before breaking.  Deltoid plates such as these are very infrequently worn due"
" to their marginal utility in improving survivability."
msgstr ""

