"Nylon armor with soft armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  "
"Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ballistic groin protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
