"A simple bag on a strap, partitioned into pouches for four STANAG 30-round "
"magazines or twelve 10-round 5.56x45mm stripper clips.  When full, this "
"bandolier is more encumbering than proper kit and slower to reload from, but "
"it at least offers a quick and cheap means of resupplying ammunition."
